opening survey)... there is now a gap in the score until the game continuation
in CHESS, Vol.15, no.169, October 1949, p22 picks up the story at move 20 - my
(JS) suggestion for moves 14-19 is as follows:} Rf7 15. Qe3 Qe8 {(Black has to
