Kc1 Rf1+ 29. Rxf1 Bxe4 30. Rff7 Nd3+ 31. Kd1 {Sources: (moves 1-14) The Chess
Bulletin, Vol.1, no.1, 3 September 1949; (moves 14-19) not known - the moves
given here are just a suggested sequence; (moves 20-end): CHESS, Vol.15, no.
169, October 1949, p25} 1-0

