suggested continuation in order to get us to the next known position...} O-O
13. Bxb6 Bxc3+ 14. bxc3 Qxb6 15. Qb3 Qc5 16. O-O Rb8 17. Rfd1 Qc7 18. Rd2 Qe7
19. Rad1 e5 20. Rd6 a5 {(The last two half-moves look unconvincing but I am at
