as given in CHESS, Vol.15, no.169, October 1949, p27... the game continues...}
Bg4 22. R1d2 a4 23. c5 $2 e4 24. h3 e3 25. fxe3 Qxe3+ 26. Kh2 Bf5 27. Rd8 Rbxd8
