36. Qb4+ $11) 36... Be6 $19 37. gxh4 Qd6 {Sources (moves 1-12) The Chess
Bulletin, Vol.1, No.1, 3 September 1949; (moves 12-21) moves not known -
possible sequence suggested by JS; (moves 21-end): CHESS, Vol.15, no.169,
October 1949, p27} 0-1

